+### 5.9 session_list
+
+Answers a `list_sessions` request with summaries for exactly the authenticated connection user. It carries metadata only — `sessionId`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, and `entryCount` — never conversation entries or credentials; the two timestamps are ISO-8601 strings on the wire. ([validated by: answers list_sessions from the authenticated user store with wire dates](../../src/transport/ws/messageHandler.test.ts#L90))
